	(descr "Atlas Scientific ORP OEM (OEM-ORP) embedded circuit, 10 castellated pins. Land pattern per ORP OEM datasheet v3.3 'Recommended pad layout' (p.26/31): pads 2.5 x 1.4 mm, 12 mm row centre to centre, 2.3 mm pitch. Body 12 x 11 mm (p.5). Pads: 1 SDA, 2 NC, 3 VCC, 4 PRB, 5 PRB GND, 6 GND, 7 INT, 8 SCL, 9 NC, 10 NC. Datasheet: never place vias under the OEM (rule area included).")
